סעיף ג׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt3-0-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "w3a", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — שגוי.</b> חיברתם את המעריכים. בחזקה של חזקה <b>כופלים</b> את המעריכים: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(a^m\\right)^k=a^{m\\cdot k}\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "w3b", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — שגוי.</b> העליתם מעריך אחד בחזקת השני. בחזקה של חזקה <b>כופלים</b> את המעריכים: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(a^m\\right)^k=a^{m\\cdot k}\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — שגוי.</b> בחזקה של חזקה כופלים את המעריכים: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(a^m\\right)^k=a^{m\\cdot k}\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["a1", "a2", "a3", "b1", "b2", "b3", "n1", "n2", "n3", "v", "w1", "w2a", "w2b", "w2c", "w3a", "w3b"], "nvariants": 50}